# GOV-01 Instructions

`.governance/` is the repository governance source of truth. Read the rule
files in numeric order before governed implementation. Keep the project intent,
active specification, backlog, and delivery evidence current.

Development begins from `develop` on an issue-scoped branch. Do not use `main`
as development input. Product changes require a focused issue, active spec,
tests appropriate to the changed contract, and a pull request to `develop`.
